# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Conan profile 相对路径被 ~/.conan2/profiles 同名路径遮蔽 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-05
# Software: elfio 3.9
# Gate: conan create / conan-verify G2
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-elfio-3.9-conan-profile-relative-path-shadowing
severity: 2
category: conan|profile|build-environment
trigger_tool: conan|conan create|conan-verify|conan profile show
phase: build|verify
approach: 使用绝对路径 -pr:h=$(pwd)/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  -pr:b=$(pwd)/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 强制指向 worktree 官方 profile，
  避免相对路径 -pr=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 命中 ~/.conan2/profiles 下同名副本

keywords: settings.os.version value not defined, conan profile, 相对路径,
  ~/.conan2/profiles, 同名遮蔽, os.version, Invalid: 'settings.os.version',
  gnu14, libstdc++11, profile 解析, 绝对路径, -pr:h, -pr:b

error_signature: Invalid: 'settings\.os\.version' value not defined|os=OHOS.*os\.version.*not defined|profile.*与文件内容不符|libcxx=libstdc\+\+11.*gnu14
match_keywords: settings.os.version, conan profile, os.version, 相对路径, 遮蔽

root_cause: 本机 ~/.conan2/profiles 下存在与 worktree 内 ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  同名的嵌套路径旧 profile（缺 os.version、libcxx=libstdc++11、cppstd=gnu14）。
  `-pr=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64` 这类相对路径被 Conan 解析时命中 home 副本而非
  worktree 官方文件；OHOS settings.yml 将 os.version 定义为必填子项（["5.0","6.0"]），
  host profile 缺失即抛 Invalid: 'settings.os.version' value not defined，构建无法启动。
affected_scope: 所有使用相对路径指定 Conan profile 且本机 ~/.conan2/profiles 存在同名
  嵌套路径副本的 OHOS 适配任务；CI 环境（无该遮蔽）与绝对路径指定不受影响

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: 用绝对路径 -pr:h=<worktree>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  -pr:b=<worktree>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 显式指向 worktree 内官方 profile；
  验证方式 conan profile show -pr:h=... -pr:b=... 应显示 os=OHOS、os.version=6.0、
  libcxx=libc++、cppstd=17、tools.build:compiler_executables
rec_description: 绝对路径强制指定官方 OHOS profile，规避 home 同名副本遮蔽
rec_command: conan create archives/e/elfio/3.9/conanfile.py --name=elfio --version=3.9 -pr:h=$(pwd)/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=$(pwd)/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -s build_type=Release
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: absolute-profile-path

doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-elfio-3.9-conan-profile-relative-path-shadowing.md

principles: P010

# ── Error excerpt (relevant lines) ──
error_text_excerpt: |
  elfio/3.9: Invalid: 'settings.os.version' value not defined
  ERROR: There are invalid packages:
  elfio/3.9: Invalid: 'settings.os.version' value not defined
  （conan profile show -pr=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 显示 host profile
   为 gnu14/libstdc++11 且无 os.version，与 worktree 内官方 profile 内容不符；
   改用绝对路径 -pr:h/-pr:b 后 os.version=6.0/libc++/cppstd=17 正确加载，
   conan create 与 test_package 双测试通过）